003e\n`--bind=\"ctrl-d:preview-half-page-down,ctrl-u:preview-half-page-up,?:toggle-preview\"`\n多分これなんですけど、提供どうしようかな","ts":"1619484789.196100","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rL6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c2a78e2-73a3-42e9-b7cc-6466c7de0fdb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"denoに閉じる方針でいくと、denoのプロセス叩いて取得にするか、それやめると二重管理になるんですよね","ts":"1619484822.196300","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p8rW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dff6d31-ba95-4970-accc-46f2e0c13016","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一応Denoを叩くオーバーヘッドが発生してしまうから難しい","ts":"1619484845.196500","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XZwa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ba2af74-82a3-4644-9ae1-ad7e694dfe44","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえずzshrcにハードコードで組み込みました\nghq連携の方をfzf-preview-denoの方に取り込んだほうがいいかもしれないですね","ts":"1619484999.196700","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VW+6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04f482f6-db66-44f4-93d9-5ae5d09d6a87","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それはありますね\nただこれ人によって使い方違うんだよなぁ・・・","ts":"1619485024.196900","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8eu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"185a4c55-217f-4aff-bf3b-8cad865a169e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分がzshで使ってるsession新しく作るやつをそのまま入れていいなら一瞬なんですけど","ts":"1619485044.197100","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"44tb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54767385-d0d7-46fb-a486-528ae0f7dc1f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"session作成はやめといて、current sessionでディレクトリ移動するだけくらいが落とし所かな","ts":"1619485067.197300","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+QXhY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0acf183f-7b19-48d0-9bdd-0af1f7c5abbb","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"難しいですね\n柔軟性もたせるならシェルからも直接触れるのがいいんですけど、denoで完結するのが多分設計としてはスリムだし……","ts":"1619485237.197500","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Et"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d7d1cb0-76e3-4435-98d6-84316bd8fb5d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁZLE使う必要はあるんで汚いことはどうしてもやってるんですけど、できるだけdenoに寄せてはいますね","ts":"1619485283.197700","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e8cXt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6da4610c-ab50-44d3-848f-33ef6f46d47a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ZLEはしょうがないとして、他のインターフェースはシェルから隠蔽するのが分かりやすい気はするんですよね\nあちこちで関数だの変数だの定義するとどこに設定があるのか分からなくなる","ts":"1619485368.197900","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DLH46"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2f061a9-1460-4e0a-8387-debff7432cee","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一応、ここにあるやつが公開インターフェイスですね\nDenoで読み込む環境変数系があるんだけどどうしようかなって感じ","ts":"1619485437.198100","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s4/On"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08c0694e-fb2a-4892-9567-463c90ef893c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/tree/main/shell/snippet/widget\u003e","ts":"1619485439.198300","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lwzr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91a05dda-d6f6-46a7-81da-0b8ebb83c619","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁここはドキュメントか・・・","ts":"1619485512.198700","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GGy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"007988f1-c177-426a-8e38-132fcce2fd39","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"設定の場所はともかくとして、足りないものがあっても最低限フォールバックは効かせるようにしたいですね\nシェル動かなくなるとどうしようもなくなりますし（さっきそうなった）","ts":"1619485604.198900","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y9M+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f787f72b-42b9-4ff1-90f0-3da3631e9dfb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分さっきのところくらいで、他のところはエラーメッセージは出すんですけど動作自体はするはず（めっちゃ画面乱れますが）","ts":"1619485642.199100","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9CM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"330315dd-e44f-40ee-a6c6-5d1c41d214a7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"実際zle壊れてなければ動くとは思うので大丈夫かなとは思ってます\nそういえばこれdenoのPATH切れてたらどうなるんだろう……","ts":"1619485713.199300","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"91C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"094e596f-d6b0-49bd-9468-a29d8938f2ad","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それは怪しいと思ってます、多分whenceした方がいい","ts":"1619485731.199500","thread_ts":"1619484717.196000","parent_user_id":"